    "text": "11 hours ago Cleta Ann Mize was born May 13, 1932, in McAlester, Oklahoma, and passed away on Sept. 5, 2026, at the age of 94. Cleta grew up in a small farmhouse as the only girl among seven brothers. Life was not always easy. Her mother passed away when Cleta was in the fifth grade, and at a young age she helped care for her father and brothers. Read full article",
